{title: Velvet Static}
{artist: Juno Park}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em]Radio's humming i[C]n the velvet static
[G]Every station sounds l[D]ike you
[Em]Dial's stuck betwee[C]n a song and a sermon
[G]Neither one of them is [D]true
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Velvet [G]static, [D]sing me to [Em]sleep
[C]All the [G]voices that I [D]used to keep
[C]Velvet [G]static, [D]fading [Em]out
[C]Tell me [D]what it's all a[G]bout
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em]Antenna's bent from [C]the winter weather
[G]Picture rolling on th[D]e screen
[Em]Somebody's laughin[C]g on a late-night rerun
[G]Laughing at the in-be[D]tween
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Velvet [G]static, [D]sing me to [Em]sleep
[C]All the [G]voices that I [D]used to keep
[C]Velvet [G]static, [D]fading [Em]out
